{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And I will guard you.</b> He needed guarding on account of Esau his brother. <b>And I will return you to this land</b> — and so it is written: 'and Jacob returned to Isaac his father.'" "<b>For I will not leave you</b> on this journey — that which I spoke to you, to return you to this land, for on the roads a person needs guarding, as it is written: 'to guard you in all your ways.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:27.831180452Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}